.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Historic_fully_rigged_ship_sail_plan.png/500px-Historic_fully_rigged_ship_sail_plan.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A three-masted vessel, square-rigged on the foremast and mainmast and lateen-rigged on the mizzenmast.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHistoric_fully_rigged_ship_sail_plan.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Wager%27s_Action_off_Cartagena_28_May_1708.jpg/500px-Wager%27s_Action_off_Cartagena_28_May_1708.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Wager%27s_Action_off_Cartagena_28_May_1708.jpg/500px-Wager%27s_Action_off_Cartagena_28_May_1708.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wager's Action off Cartagena by Samuel Scott shows the 1708 sinking of the Spanish galleon San José","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWager's_Action_off_Cartagena_28_May_1708.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Gale%C3%B3n_Andaluc%C3%ADa_Quebec_City_02.jpg/500px-Gale%C3%B3n_Andaluc%C3%ADa_Quebec_City_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Gale%C3%B3n_Andaluc%C3%ADa_Quebec_City_02.jpg/1280px-Gale%C3%B3n_Andaluc%C3%ADa_Quebec_City_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Gale%C3%B3n_Andaluc%C3%ADa_Quebec_City_02.jpg/500px-Gale%C3%B3n_Andaluc%C3%ADa_Quebec_City_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"El Galeón, a 17th-century Spanish galleon replica in Quebec City in 2016.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGale%C3%B3n_Andaluc%